<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        td { padding: 5px 0; }
        .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0;">MEDICAL</h2>
            <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0;">COLLEGE</h2>
            <h2 style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0;">OF WISCONSIN</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0;">Office of Human Resources - Benefits</h3>
            <h3 style="margin: 0;">MCW Graduate School Tuition Course Approval / Authorization Form</h3>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">A full or partial tuition benefit may be available pursuant to Policy #<span data-field="policy_number">{{ policy_number }}</span> to full time and full professional Effort Faculty, Instructors, Post Doctoral Fellows and full time exempt and non-exempt Staff. <span data-field="approval_statement">{{ approval_statement }}</span> Any tax liability, if applicable under IRS Code, is the responsibility of the employee.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">This benefit is for Tuition ONLY. The maximum pre-tax benefit is determined by Section 127 of the Internal Revenue Code and will be offset by the Staff Tuition Reimbursement Policy for exempt and non-exempt Staff.</p>

    <div style="border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">*FORM MUST BE SUBMITTED PRIOR TO COMPLETION OF REGISTRATION*</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-header">Section 1 Course Approval</div>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%; padding-right: 20px;">
                <p>Name: <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></p>
                <p>Employee ID Number: <span data-field="employee_id">{{ employee_id }}</span></p>
                <p>Home Address: <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>Department: <span data-field="department">{{ department }}</span></p>
                <p>Title: <span data-field="title">{{ title }}</span></p>
                <p>Employee Status: Full Time or Full Professional Effort (circle one)</p>
                <p>Name of Degree (if applicable): <span data-field="degree_name">{{ degree_name }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
                <p>Course Number and Title: <span data-field="course_number_title">{{ course_number_title }}</span></p>
                <p>Number of Credits/Cost of course: <span data-field="course_credits_cost">{{ course_credits_cost }}</span></p>
                <p>Dates of Course: from <span data-field="course_start_date">{{ course_start_date }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_date">{{ course_end_date }}</span></p>
                <p>Time of Day: from <span data-field="course_start_time">{{ course_start_time }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_time">{{ course_end_time }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
                <p>Course Number and Title: <span data-field="course_number_title_2">{{ course_number_title_2 }}</span></p>
                <p>Number of Credits/Cost of course: <span data-field="course_credits_cost_2">{{ course_credits_cost_2 }}</span></p>
                <p>Dates of Course: from <span data-field="course_start_date_2">{{ course_start_date_2 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_date_2">{{ course_end_date_2 }}</span></p>
                <p>Time of Day: from <span data-field="course_start_time_2">{{ course_start_time_2 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_time_2">{{ course_end_time_2 }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
                <p>Course Number and Title: <span data-field="course_number_title_3">{{ course_number_title_3 }}</span></p>
                <p>Number of Credits/Cost of course: <span data-field="course_credits_cost_3">{{ course_credits_cost_3 }}</span></p>
                <p>Dates of Course: from <span data-field="course_start_date_3">{{ course_start_date_3 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_date_3">{{ course_end_date_3 }}</span></p>
                <p>Time of Day: from <span data-field="course_start_time_3">{{ course_start_time_3 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_time_3">{{ course_end_time_3 }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%; vertical-align: top;">
                <p>Course Number and Title: <span data-field="course_number_title_4">{{ course_number_title_4 }}</span></p>
                <p>Number of Credits/Cost of course: <span data-field="course_credits_cost_4">{{ course_credits_cost_4 }}</span></p>
                <p>Dates of Course: from <span data-field="course_start_date_4">{{ course_start_date_4 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_date_4">{{ course_end_date_4 }}</span></p>
                <p>Time of Day: from <span data-field="course_start_time_4">{{ course_start_time_4 }}</span> to <span data-field="course_end_time_4">{{ course_end_time_4 }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <input type="checkbox" data-field="nrsra_check" value="{{ nrsra_check }}"> Check this box if you are a National Research Service Award (NRSA) Recipient
        </label>
    </div>

    <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>Employee Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="employee_signature_date">{{ employee_signature_date }}</span> Printed Employee Name: <span data-field="employee_printed_name">{{ employee_printed_name }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>*Supervisor Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="supervisor_signature_date">{{ supervisor_signature_date }}</span> Printed Supervisor Name: <span data-field="supervisor_printed_name">{{ supervisor_printed_name }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-field="approved_dept_funds" value="{{ approved_dept_funds }}"> Approved for Departmental Funds
                </label>
                <p>Amount Paid by Department $: <span data-field="dept_amount">{{ dept_amount }}</span></p>
                <p>Account to be charged: _________________________</p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-field="not_approved_dept_funds" value="{{ not_approved_dept_funds }}"> Not Approved To Be Paid By Department
                </label>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>*Chairman/Administrator: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="chairman_admin_date">{{ chairman_admin_date }}</span> Printed Chairman/Administrator Name: <span data-field="chairman_admin_printed_name">{{ chairman_admin_printed_name }}</span></p>
                <p>Department Chairman/Administrator please route to the Graduate School</p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>MCW Graduate School Verification Date: <span data-field="mcw_verification_date">{{ mcw_verification_date }}</span> Printed MCW Graduate School Verifier Name: <span data-field="mcw_verifier_name">{{ mcw_verifier_name }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Keep a copy for your records. This form will be processed and a copy returned to you as soon as administratively possible.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-header">Section 2 Office of Human Resources/Benefits Approval</div>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-field="staff_tuition_policy" value="{{ staff_tuition_policy }}"> Staff Tuition (Policy HR.BN.100)
                </label>
                <p>Approved (subject to reimbursement caps)</p>
                <p>Amount Approved: <span data-field="staff_tuition_amount">{{ staff_tuition_amount }}</span></p>
                <p>Benefits Representative Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="benefits_rep_date">{{ benefits_rep_date }}</span></p>
                <p>Benefits Manager Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="benefits_mgr_date">{{ benefits_mgr_date }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-field="mcw_grad_benefit_policy" value="{{ mcw_grad_benefit_policy }}"> MCW Graduate School Benefit (Policy # HR.BN.140)
                </label>
                <p>Amount Approved: <span data-field="mcw_grad_benefit_amount">{{ mcw_grad_benefit_amount }}</span></p>
                <p>Tax Determination:</p>
                <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-field="not_taxable_mcw" value="{{ not_taxable_mcw }}"> Not Taxable through MCW
                </label>
                <p>Taxable Amount $: <span data-field="taxable_amount">{{ taxable_amount }}</span></p>
                <p>(If the taxable amount is $500 or less, the taxation will occur on one payroll.)</p>
                <p>(Monthly Paid) Taxed on the following payrolls: _________________________</p>
                <p>(Semi-Monthly Paid) Taxed on the following payrolls: _________________________</p>
                <p>Taxable Benefit each payroll: $ <span data-field="taxable_benefit_per_payroll">{{ taxable_benefit_per_payroll }}</span></p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <tr>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <p>Payroll/Tax Specialist Signature: _________________________ Date: <span data-field="payroll_tax_specialist_date">{{ payroll_tax_specialist_date }}</span></p>
            </td>
            <td style="width: 50%;">
                <!-- Placeholder for any additional fields if needed, maintaining layout balance -->
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>